# ============================================================
# Matatu ETA API — REST Client Tests
# VS Code extension: humao.rest-client
# ============================================================
# Usage:
#   1. Set @baseUrl and credentials in the Variables section.
#   2. Run each request with "Send Request" (click the link above each block).
#   3. Copy tokens from responses into the variables below.
# ============================================================


### ─── Variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
@baseUrl        = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken     = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@matAdminToken  = PASTE_MAT_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@passengerToken = PASTE_PASSENGER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@stageId        = 1
@vehicleId      = 1
@userId         = 2
@resetUserId    = 1
@resetToken     = PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE
@tempToken      = PASTE_TEMP_2FA_TOKEN_HERE


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                    AUTH ROUTES                           ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 1. Register a new user (first user becomes Admin)
# POST /api/auth/register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


###

### 2. Login — returns accessToken + sets refreshToken cookie
# POST /api/auth/login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


###

### 3. Get current Admin profile
# GET /api/auth/me/admin   (requires Admin role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 4. Get current Passenger profile
# GET /api/auth/me/passenger   (requires Passenger role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/passenger
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 5. Get current MatAdmin profile
# GET /api/auth/me/mat-admin   (requires MatAdmin role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/mat-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 6. Update profile (name and / or phone number)
# PUT /api/auth/me   (any authenticated role)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "phoneNumber": "0712345678"
}


###

### 7. Refresh access token
# POST /api/auth/refresh-token
# Cookie refreshToken must be present (set automatically after login).
# The expired / current access token is still required in the header.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 8. Logout
# POST /api/auth/logout   (any authenticated role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 9. Request password reset email
# POST /api/auth/requestPasswordReset
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/requestPasswordReset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}


###

### 10. Reset password using token from email
# POST /api/auth/resetpassword/:id/:token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resetpassword/{{resetUserId}}/{{resetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword123"
}


###

### 11. 2FA — Generate secret & QR code (step 1 of setup)
# POST /api/auth/2fa/setup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 12. 2FA — Verify TOTP token to enable 2FA (step 2 of setup)
# POST /api/auth/2fa/verify
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "123456"
}


###

### 13. 2FA — Disable 2FA
# POST /api/auth/2fa/disable
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 14. 2FA — Complete login with TOTP code
# POST /api/auth/2fa/login
# tempToken is returned from a normal /login when twoFactorRequired: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tempToken": "{{tempToken}}",
  "token": "123456"
}


###

### 15. Google OAuth — Initiate sign-in (opens browser redirect)
# GET /api/auth/google
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                    ETA ROUTES                            ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 16. Get ETA for a stage (any authenticated role)
# GET /api/eta/:stageId
GET {{baseUrl}}/eta/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


### 17. Get ETA — stage not found (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/eta/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                   STAGE ROUTES                           ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 18. Get all stages (any authenticated role)
# GET /api/stages
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 19. Get subscription status for a stage
# GET /api/stages/:stageId/subscription
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stageId}}/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 20. Subscribe to SMS alert for a stage
# POST /api/stages/:stageId/subscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stageId}}/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 21. Unsubscribe from SMS alert for a stage
# POST /api/stages/:stageId/unsubscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/stages/{{stageId}}/unsubscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                   ADMIN ROUTES                           ║
# ║         All endpoints require Admin role                 ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 22. Admin — Get live vehicle dashboard data
# GET /api/admin/dashboard-data
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard-data
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 23. Admin — Get all users (supports search and role filter)
# GET /api/admin/users
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?q=&role=&limit=25&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 24. Admin — Create a new Admin or MatAdmin user
# POST /api/admin/users
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Mat Admin",
  "email": "matadmin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "MatAdmin"
}


###

### 25. Admin — Block / unblock a user
# PUT /api/admin/users/:id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "disabled": true
}


###

### 26. Admin — Delete a user
# DELETE /api/admin/users/:id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 27. Admin — Get all feedback (paginated)
# GET /api/admin/feedback
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/feedback?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 28. Admin — Get all MatAdmins (for dropdown)
# GET /api/admin/mat-admins
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/mat-admins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 29. Admin — Get all stages (paginated)
# GET /api/admin/stages
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stages?limit=25&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 30. Admin — Create a stage
# POST /api/admin/stages
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Westlands Stage",
  "latitude": -1.2672,
  "longitude": 36.8062
}


###

### 31. Admin — Get all vehicles (paginated)
# GET /api/admin/vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles?limit=25&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 32. Admin — Create a vehicle
# POST /api/admin/vehicles
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": "CAR_001",
  "plateNumber": "KBA 001A",
  "ownerId": 2
}


###

### 33. Admin — Delete a vehicle
# DELETE /api/admin/vehicles/:id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###

### 34. Admin — Assign vehicle to a stage
# POST /api/admin/stages/assign-vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/stages/assign-vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": 1,
  "vehicleId": 1
}


###

### 35. Admin — Remove vehicle from a stage
# DELETE /api/admin/stages/:stageId/vehicles/:vehicleId
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/stages/1/vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                  FEEDBACK ROUTES                         ║
# ║         All endpoints require Passenger role             ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 36. Passenger — Get all vehicles (for feedback form dropdown)
# GET /api/feedback/vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/feedback/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 37. Passenger — Submit feedback for a vehicle
# POST /api/feedback
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Punctual and clean matatu."
}


###

### 38. Feedback — validation error (rating out of range, expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "This should fail."
}


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                 MAT-ADMIN ROUTES                         ║
# ║         All endpoints require MatAdmin role              ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 39. MatAdmin — Dashboard summary (totals for today)
# GET /api/mat-admin/dashboard-summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/dashboard-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 40. MatAdmin — Live vehicle status dashboard
# GET /api/mat-admin/dashboard-data
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/dashboard-data
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 41. MatAdmin — Vehicle stats with daily distance, trips & feedback
# GET /api/mat-admin/vehicle-stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicle-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 42. MatAdmin — Fleet aggregate chart data (daily)
# GET /api/mat-admin/fleet-aggregate-data?period=daily|weekly|monthly
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/fleet-aggregate-data?period=daily
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 43. MatAdmin — Fleet aggregate chart data (weekly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/fleet-aggregate-data?period=weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 44. MatAdmin — Fleet aggregate chart data (monthly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/fleet-aggregate-data?period=monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 45. MatAdmin — Chart data for a specific vehicle (daily)
# GET /api/mat-admin/vehicles/:vehicleId/chart-data?period=daily|weekly|monthly
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/chart-data?period=daily
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 46. MatAdmin — Chart data for a specific vehicle (weekly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/chart-data?period=weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 47. MatAdmin — Chart data for a specific vehicle (monthly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/chart-data?period=monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


###

### 48. MatAdmin — Create a vehicle
# POST /api/mat-admin/vehicles
POST {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": "CAR_MAT_001",
  "plateNumber": "KCB 123X"
}


###

### 49. MatAdmin — Get own vehicles
# GET /api/mat-admin/vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/mat-admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{matAdminToken}}


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║               ERROR / EDGE CASE TESTS                   ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 50. No token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages


###

### 51. Wrong role — Passenger hitting Admin endpoint (expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard-data
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}


###

### 52. Malformed JSON body — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bad@example.com", "password":


###

### 53. Invalid token format — expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Token invalid_format_here


###

### 54. Expired / tampered token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.tampered.signature
